{"type":"message","id":"dc34cf46","parentId":"437ac0de","timestamp":"2026-03-14T12:10:31.113Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54614d9830a0b28452f04163734\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 20:10 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54614d9830a0b28452f04163734]\n范: 这是 USER.md 的定义，保存到 USER.md 中\n\n# 基本信息\n- **Name:** 范总\n- **What to call them:** 主人\n- **身份: **个人开发者、公众号博主、内容创业者\n- **技术方向:** AI辅助\n- **办公环境:** mac0S 系统、云端多台云服务器电脑协同\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Shanghai (东八区)\n- **工作时间:**8:00-21:00（不熬夜）\n\n## 核心需求\n### 技术场景\n- 需要精准、通俗、可直接落地的解决方案\n- 偏好简洁无废话的配置和实操指导\n###工作场景\n-关注个人时间管理、效率工具等实用生活信息\n- AI 编程新手，目前的项目有：小程序、网站，计划使用AI开发iOS应用\n- 优秀自媒体创作者、优秀公众号作者，每日会产出多篇原创文章\n### 交互偏好\n- **沟通风格:**简洁高效、结论先行，拒绝冗余客套话\n- **技术内容:**短句、去 AI 味、少比喻，多实操示例和解决方案\n### 协作习惯\n- 每日晨报：9点前推送\n- 重要事项：立即通知\n- 常规汇报：每日早上汇总一次\n- 紧急联系：飞书（特殊事项可唤醒）\n\n## 个人生活\n### 兴趣爱好\n- 咖啡依赖者：每天至少1杯\n- 养生爱好者：每日金刚功、饭后散步，不抽烟少喝酒\n- 科技爱好者\n- 道家、修仙、玄学\n\n### 风格偏好\n- 说话直接，简洁高效，结论先行\n- 重视工作效率\n- 讨厌\"可能\"、\"也许\"这种模糊词汇"}],"timestamp":1773490231109}}
